<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95183" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			3.48
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			<u>Fab.</u>
			7
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the
			dark</i>, joined with a Verb, of persons, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> before morning, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλείπετο τῆς νυκτὸς ὅσον σκοταίους
					διελθεῖν τὸ πεδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.1.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτι ς. παρῆλθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.5.18
				</span></i>
			; or, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> after
			nightfall, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤδη ς. ἀναγαγών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.1.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοταῖοι προσιόντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.2.17
				</span></i>
			: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνεφαῖος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
			<i>dark</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					1.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span> D.S.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέδραι</span>
			<i>in the dark</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
